        "brief": "Answer one question from the run state alone, at any moment of a run: which special would the Tanuki copy right now, and what does its copy consist of. Nothing here locks the target (T1 is the next feature) or builds the Tanuki's fighter (T0). T3's first tie-break needs to know which special gained a level most recently, which the run does not record today."
